<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz January GDP rises 0.1 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz January GDP rises 0.1 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's January gross domestic product (GDP) rose 0.1 percent from the same 1996 period, the National Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p> KYRGYZ GDP		     Jan 97    Jan-Dec 96    Jan 96</p>
<p> year-on-year pct change    +0.1	  +5.6	  +0.2</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
